---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Services">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16">
    <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-indigo-600 tracking-wide uppercase eyebrow mb-2">What I do</p>
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-5xl mb-8">
      Copy that converts. Content that inspires.
    </h1>
    
    <div class="prose prose-lg prose-indigo max-w-none text-slate-600">
      <p class="lede text-xl font-medium text-slate-800">
        With more than 15 years as a journalist, copywriter and content strategist under my belt, I am uniquely equipped to fulfil your creative requirements.
      </p>
      <p class="lede mb-12">
        Whether you want short-form copy for your specific audience or long-form content that builds your global credibility, I will provide a precision solution by:
      </p>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12">
        <div class="service-block">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Narrative development</h3>
          <p class="desc">Your brand needs to look and feel the same at every touchpoint — wherever it shows up, whoever's doing the talking. I will help you achieve this with tailored brand guidelines and tone of voice frameworks.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="service-block">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Ads (print, digital, OOH)</h3>
          <p class="desc">At LIV Golf I have written ads for city-wide takeovers in the world's most electric cities. Now I can channel this same creativity into your cause.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="service-block">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">SEO, AEO and GEO</h3>
          <p class="desc">The advent of AI summaries has changed the rules of SEO. I work with this new reality every day and can give you content that's ahead of the latest trends.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="service-block">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Thought-leadership</h3>
          <p class="desc">As a former journalist and newspaper editor, I will help you cement your thought leadership with persuasive long-form content, including whitepapers, op-eds and detailed guides.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="service-block">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Content Marketing</h3>
          <p class="desc">99% of content marketing looks like&hellip; well, marketing. I will put you in the other 1% with content that solves real problems and adds genuine value to your customers' lives.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="service-block">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Script development</h3>
          <p class="desc">Having written for everything from hit podcast series to national radio channels, I can provide tailored scripts for all your audio and video platforms.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="mt-16 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-8 text-center">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">Not sure which service fits your brief?</h2>
        <p class="text-lg mb-6">Tell me what you're trying to achieve on a free discovery call, and I'll recommend the right mix — no obligation, no jargon.</p>
        <a href="mailto:contact@invincibleink.com" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3 border border-transparent rounded-md shadow-sm text-base font-medium text-white bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-700">
          Book a discovery call
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
